    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dream of becoming a billionaire by draining rigged carnival machines? Welcome to <strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong>, the game where you throw your fake money into shady attractions just for the thrill of watching numbers go up (or not).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game that reeks of sweat, blurry pixels, and questionable game design. Built with the blood, sweat, and tears of a developer who probably should have stayed an accountant but instead decided to create his &quot;masterpiece&quot;\u2014badly optimized and with a certain disdain for usability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 A GAMEPLAY EXPERIENCE AS ADDICTIVE AS IT IS UNFAIR \u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 Throw your fake cash into machines as rigged as your last failed relationship:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb0 <strong>Slot Machine</strong> \u2013 Win big! (Well\u2026 if the algorithm decides to let you.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 <strong>Coin Pusher</strong> \u2013 Watch coins fall and experience a shameful level of excitement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddbe <strong>Claw Machine</strong> \u2013 A physics system straight out of a nightmare. Good luck grabbing that cursed gold bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Roulette</strong> \u2013 Bet everything on red, instantly regret it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2663\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Blackjack</strong>\u2013 Bank always wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>KeyMaster </strong>\u2013 Look at it bounce like a half-cooked spaghetti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd93 <strong>Zebra Race </strong>\u2013 Don't... Don't play this. It is the best way to win.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 THE FORTUNE TELLER MACHINE: A MYSTERIOUS VOID \u2b50</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too much money? Seek wisdom from <strong>The Fortune Teller Machine</strong>, a mystical entity that promises to reveal your destiny\u2026 but, let\u2019s be honest, mostly mocks you. <strong>Mystical? Yes. Useful? Absolutely not.</strong> But who knows? Maybe it\u2019s right (spoiler: it\u2019s not).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 A SOUND EXPERIENCE STRAIGHT FROM HELL \ud83c\udfa7</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound in this game was <strong>personally crafted by the developer</strong>. And guess what? He has <strong>zero musical talent</strong>. Expect off-key jingles, suspiciously sourced sound effects, and a soundtrack that will make you question your love for music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 FEATURES WE PROBABLY SHOULD HAVE TESTED \ud83d\udd25</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2c <strong>Graphics</strong> \u2013 An unintentional tribute to the PS2 era, but blurrier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b <strong>Optimization</strong> \u2013 Runs at <strong>22 FPS on a gaming PC</strong> yet somehow hits 60 FPS on a toaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude21 <strong>Guaranteed Rage</strong> \u2013 Every session is a life lesson in existential frustration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong> is the game that will make you say:<br><i>&quot;Why am I still playing this?&quot;</i><br>and then <i>&quot;Alright, just one more round...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on Steam. Buy it, or just throw your money out the window\u2014the result will be the same. \ud83c\udfa1\ud83c\udfb0\ud83d\udcb8</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dream of becoming a billionaire by draining rigged carnival machines? Welcome to <strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong>, the game where you throw your fake money into shady attractions just for the thrill of watching numbers go up (or not).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game that reeks of sweat, blurry pixels, and questionable game design. Built with the blood, sweat, and tears of a developer who probably should have stayed an accountant but instead decided to create his &quot;masterpiece&quot;\u2014badly optimized and with a certain disdain for usability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 A GAMEPLAY EXPERIENCE AS ADDICTIVE AS IT IS UNFAIR \u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 Throw your fake cash into machines as rigged as your last failed relationship:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb0 <strong>Slot Machine</strong> \u2013 Win big! (Well\u2026 if the algorithm decides to let you.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 <strong>Coin Pusher</strong> \u2013 Watch coins fall and experience a shameful level of excitement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddbe <strong>Claw Machine</strong> \u2013 A physics system straight out of a nightmare. Good luck grabbing that cursed gold bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Roulette</strong> \u2013 Bet everything on red, instantly regret it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2663\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Blackjack</strong>\u2013 Bank always wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>KeyMaster </strong>\u2013 Look at it bounce like a half-cooked spaghetti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd93 <strong>Zebra Race </strong>\u2013 Don't... Don't play this. It is the best way to win.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 THE FORTUNE TELLER MACHINE: A MYSTERIOUS VOID \u2b50</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too much money? Seek wisdom from <strong>The Fortune Teller Machine</strong>, a mystical entity that promises to reveal your destiny\u2026 but, let\u2019s be honest, mostly mocks you. <strong>Mystical? Yes. Useful? Absolutely not.</strong> But who knows? Maybe it\u2019s right (spoiler: it\u2019s not).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 A SOUND EXPERIENCE STRAIGHT FROM HELL \ud83c\udfa7</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound in this game was <strong>personally crafted by the developer</strong>. And guess what? He has <strong>zero musical talent</strong>. Expect off-key jingles, suspiciously sourced sound effects, and a soundtrack that will make you question your love for music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 FEATURES WE PROBABLY SHOULD HAVE TESTED \ud83d\udd25</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2c <strong>Graphics</strong> \u2013 An unintentional tribute to the PS2 era, but blurrier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b <strong>Optimization</strong> \u2013 Runs at <strong>22 FPS on a gaming PC</strong> yet somehow hits 60 FPS on a toaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude21 <strong>Guaranteed Rage</strong> \u2013 Every session is a life lesson in existential frustration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong> is the game that will make you say:<br><i>&quot;Why am I still playing this?&quot;</i><br>and then <i>&quot;Alright, just one more round...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on Steam. Buy it, or just throw your money out the window\u2014the result will be the same. \ud83c\udfa1\ud83c\udfb0\ud83d\udcb8</p>",
    "short_description": "Funfair Billionaire is the ultimate experience of a carnival as shady as a scratched-off lottery ticket. Rigged machines, sadistic physics, and a fate sealed by an algorithm that despises you\u2014because deep down, you enjoy suffering. One more round? Of course.",
